 {file}←file Add ns;path;t;cut;dateText;date;file;new;i
⍝ 'path/to/index.html' Add(title:'Hello world' ⋄ author:'Adám Brudzewsky' ⋄ tags:'example' 'idiom' ⋄ date:2026 05 04 ⋄ url:'https://example.com')
⍝ tags can also be space-separated: 'example idiom'
⍝ date can also be single number (20260504) or text ('20260504' or '2026-05-04')

 t←⎕XML ⎕OPT'Markup' 'Preserve'⊃⎕NGET file

 dateText←t[;3]⌿⍨(4=⊢/t)∧⎕D∊⍨⊃¨3⌷⍤1⊢t
 :If ⍬≡0/ns.date
     date←100⊥ns.date
 :Else
     date←⍎date∩⎕D
 :EndIf
 i←date⍸⍥-⍨10(⍎↑∩⎕D⍨)¨dateText
 new←[
     2 'article' ''('class' ⋄ 1↓' \w'⎕R'\u0'∊' ',¨⊆ns.tags)7
     3 'a'ns.title('href'ns.url)5
     3 ''(ns.author,⍨', ',⍨∊'-',¨@5 7⍕date)'' 4
 ]
 :If 0=i
     cut←¯3+⌊/⎕D⍳⍨⊃¨t[;3]
 :Else
     cut←t[;3]⍳i⌷dateText
 :EndIf
 t(↑⍪new⍪↓)⍨←cut

 file 1 ⎕NPUT ⎕OPT'NEOL' 2⍨'<br></br>'⎕R'<br/>'⎕XML t
